  <p id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBD">彬</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBD">思文</persName>，好文章，習篆隸，與<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC">志</persName>齊名。<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:u0018" type="unresolved">時人</rs>為<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:u0021" type="unresolved">之</rs>語曰：「三真六草，為天下寶。」<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0037" ref="kix_r92_2ed">齊武帝</persName>起舊宮，<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0044" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBD">彬</persName>獻賦，文辭典麗。尚<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0054" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">齊高帝</persName>女<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0058" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_A">臨海長公主</persName>，拜駙馬都尉。仕齊，曆太子中庶子，徙永嘉太守。卜室于積穀山，有終焉之志。梁天監中，曆吏部尚書、秘書監。卒，諡惠。<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0119" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBD">彬</persName>立身清白，推賢接士，有士君子風。<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0136" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBD">彬</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangbin-digital:p001:m0138" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBB">寂</persName>。</p>
</text>
